# Runtime data — never committed. Holds field.db, uploads/, apk/
#
# Anchored with a leading slash. Written as bare `data/` it matches a directory
# named data at ANY depth, which silently excluded app/api/admin/data/ and
# app/admin/data/ — the whole Data Lapangan feature was missing from the repo
# and only surfaced when CI ran the tests against a clean checkout.
/data/

